This project is a Rust port of DigUp (https://github.com/ARahim3/DigUp),
Copyright (c) ARahim3, released under the MIT License.

The on-disk index schema (version 5), search scoring, prompts and indexing
constants are taken from that project's Swift sources so that indexes and
search quality stay comparable. Keep DigUp's MIT copyright notice with any
redistribution of this code.

Also used: llama.cpp b11461 (MIT, compiled into the app), EmbeddingGemma 2 by Google DeepMind (Apache 2.0,
downloaded at run time, not shipped in the app). Full component list and Rust crate licenses:
docs/THIRD-PARTY.md and scripts/gen-third-party-licenses.sh.

Optional OCR engine (cargo feature `lighton` of digup-ocr): LightOnOCR-3-0.8B by LightOn
(https://huggingface.co/lightonai/LightOnOCR-3-0.8B), Apache License 2.0. We use the community GGUF conversion
by mradermacher (https://huggingface.co/mradermacher/LightOnOCR-3-0.8B-GGUF, pinned revision in
crates/digup-models), whose GGUF metadata declares `general.license = apache-2.0`.
